        "line": 164,
        "text": "def AngularIndependent (G : Geometry s κ) (a : Family D) : Prop := ∀ n i x, x ∈ s.domain → along (G.angular n) (fun y => a n y i) x = 0  -- the Lean form of \"C_m is independent of θ\", carried as a hypothesis"
